OL,3,ABurnham scraps controversial plans to
OL,4,Acurb jury trials
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,7,Fscrapped controversial plans to curb
OL,8,Fsome jury trials.
OL,10,FSir Keir Starmer's government had
OL,11,Fintroduced proposals to allow judges to
OL,12,Fmake the sole decision on cases that
OL,13,Fwould lead to a sentence of less than
OL,14,Fthree years.
OL,16,FThe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) said only
OL,17,Fcomplex fraud and financial offences
OL,18,Fwould be judge-alone - and it proposes
OL,19,Fthat thousands of medium-level crimes
OL,20,Fshould stay with volunteer magistrates,
OL,21,Fwho sit without a jury.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
