OL,3,A'It's literally a lottery': Glastonbury
OL,4,A2027 tickets sell out in 40 minutes
OL,5,
OL,6,FTickets for Glastonbury 2027 have sold
OL,7,Fout
OL,9,FA new queuing system was introduced
OL,10,Fthis year, which means each registered
OL,11,Fattendee only gets one place in the
OL,12,Fline - one festival veteran says "it's
OL,13,Fliterally a lottery"
OL,15,FTickets to Britain's biggest music
OL,16,Ffestival now cost more than #400
OL,17,F($528). In 1970, the event cost #1 and
OL,18,Fincluded a free pint of milk from
OL,19,FWorthy Farm
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
